  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I see. Dasein wants to host another summit between Arcanum and Cabal. I am unsure. The last one did not end in peace.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_StormTrainerF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Ione_Virga_AR-PostWL_008.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340969,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Yah. But that was because of an unrelated event. The Cabal was true to its word. Apart from outliers like Manticore.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Mole_Scholar_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Maulwurf_von_Trap_AR-PostWL_001.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340969,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The Old One was a complicated fellow and he may not have wanted peace for the right reasons. But peace still is the right answer, no?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Mole_Scholar_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Maulwurf_von_Trap_AR-PostWL_002.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340969,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Hmm. It would be preferrable to not constantly worry about Cabal infiltration. Very well, Wizard, return to Novus. We will give this peace a chance.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_StormTrainerF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Ione_Virga_AR-PostWL_009.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340969,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC05_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Wizard. I hear your trip to my homeland was eventful. Yes, much like Novus, Wallaru is a world of contradictions.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Zander_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Zander_AR-PostWL_014.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340970,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC05_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I can only hope the both of them will find success in negotiating their differences.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Zander_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Zander_AR-PostWL_015.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340970,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-DEstate-NPC26-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Scholars, Cabalists, Heroes, Wizard - thank you all for joining me. The last time a Summit like this was attempted, it was ruined.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_Dasein_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Dasein_AR-PostWL_028.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1717127,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-DEstate-NPC26-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "That was my fault. But today, I hope I can put it right. Today, I hope we can all stop looking back to what we were.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_Dasein_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Dasein_AR-PostWL_029.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1717127,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-DEstate-NPC26-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The First World is gone, the Nothing is gone, ephemeral vapors scattered amongst countless yesterdays. Tomorrow isn't built of vapor...",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_Dasein_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Dasein_AR-PostWL_030.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1717127,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-DEstate-NPC26-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "It is not mortared by memory. It is made from us. Each of us is a brick in the world we wish to build. Only together can we determine its shape.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_Dasein_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Dasein_AR-PostWL_031.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1717127,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I feel... you are right. The Arcanum cannot be merely a hoard of precious knowledge. The Wizard has for a long time now...",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_StormTrainerF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Ione_Virga_AR-PostWL_010.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340969,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "...Shown us our knowledge must be applied to be useful.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_StormTrainerF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Ione_Virga_AR-PostWL_011.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340969,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-DEstate-NPC26-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Applied the right way. Not chasing after ghosts, but guiding those who are still here.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dromel_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Sandiago_AR-PostWL_134.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1717127,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-DEstate-NPC26-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Then let the Schism be mended. Together you can complete great feats, accomplish the impossible and build a Spiral where everyone can be heroes.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_Dasein_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Dasein_AR-PostWL_032.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1717127,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Agreed. Wizard, one last task, unlock the World Door to the Arcanum. Show the Cabal to the Tree of Knowledge.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_StormTrainerF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Ione_Virga_AR-PostWL_012.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340969,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC25_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "They don't seem eager to follow you, your new Cabal friends. After generations of conflict, trepidation should be expected.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_Sybil_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Sybil_AR-PostWL_026.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1452087,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC25_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Look back to Wallaru to see that firsthand. Malus does not die quickly. It lingers there even now. Your companions can't fight it alone.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_Sybil_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Sybil_AR-PostWL_027.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1452087,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC25_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I am heartened you and Dasein learned all you needed there, as I knew you would. The story ended where it began.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_Sybil_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Sybil_AR-PostWL_028.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1452087,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC25_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Your story is far from over. You'll explore new worlds, reunite with old friends and fight new villains. The Spiral will always need its Scion.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_Sybil_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Sybil_AR-PostWL_029.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1452087,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
